Comment: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:21.78,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:28.79,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:46.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base made contact with\Nthe Zanzibar captained by Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}L...but it was unable to shoot it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The most that the Gundam was able to do\Nwas defeat the mobile armor Bigro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's another mobile suit approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:16.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are the guys who hit the showers?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the decks, maintaining their machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:20.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, launch one or two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who should we send out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoever's in the best condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:25.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell him to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:29.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato, please head out in the Guntank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All machines remain on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.65,0:02:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll prepare the Guntank for a sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's just one enemy craft?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're only sending out the Guntank?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Kai's still in the shower room...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand. I've got a few ideas myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have Hayato go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:51.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro says he'll launch in the Gundam too.\NIs that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's fine. Let him launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:58.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla. Why don't you lie down for a while.\NUse one of the rooms in the gravity block.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:00.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the enemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:03.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got Lieutenant Sleggar to cover you.\NGet some rest. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:06.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.\NI'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were the results of her medical exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing out of the ordinary.\NShe's in perfect health.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:25.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm proceeding on a direct course.\NContact with the enemy in 110 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:26.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll cut the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:39.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's that mobile armor?\NIt's different from the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Dimitri took off?\NEven though I clearly warned him not to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you let him do it,\Nwithout my authorization?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:51.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say this, Captain Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but you would have stopped him\Nfrom avenging Lieutenant Tokwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:04:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, Dimitri already has experience\Nas a test pilot for the mobile armor Zakrello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:03.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of such a mobile armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was abandoned\Nbefore it could be properly tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:09.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Dimitri said that\Nthe Zakrello's diffuse beam cannon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you that this is our own backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, we can even contact\NDren's patrol fleet for assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know how you all respected Tokwan, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dimitri must return as soon as he's satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Thank you very much, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything like this ever happens again\Nyou will be court-martialed, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's fast. It's different from the last one...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's loaded with missiles, too...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more shot oughtta wipe out\Nthat mobile armor-wannabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:04.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I miss it...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't hit it! Hayato, just hang in there...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another mobile suit?! But it's awfully fast.\NWhat could possibly have such speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy's annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll take care of that clunker first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fool. Same old move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:57.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No mistake.\NI made a direct hit to his engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My computer predicted his moves easily.\NWhat was he trying to do anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:07.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro? Do you read me?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Destruction of mobile armor confirmed.{\i}\N{\i1}Please return at once.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No enemy movements currently detected.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger. Two hits taken by Gundam.\NI'll return to the ship quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NDid two battles in a row tire you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:35.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Gundam's right arm was damaged, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we've wiped out the immediate enemies.\NThere's no need to be so hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're only saying that because\Nyou don't know Char, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be after us soon with a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every other word on the bridge is "Char".\NIs he really that special?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He thinks quickly on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:56.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He even pilots mobile suits himself.\NHe's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd love to meet this Char guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you need to get more rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, take a break.\NI'll look after things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'll head up to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant! What about the main cannons?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright will yell at you. We're in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a pest, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's talk again when things quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.47,0:07:27.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's always about my brother, isn't it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:47.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we contact the Camel fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! We're tracing its\Ncourse on the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open up a laser comm channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:07:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry about what happened\Nwith Dimitri earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:02.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget it. I couldn't care less\Nabout a weapon I wasn't even aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll make it up to me one day, Mulligan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:10.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Lieutenant Dren of the Camel fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's been awhile, Lt. Commander Char...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or rather, it's Captain Char now, isn't it.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit, Dren.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're pursuing the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From where your ships are right now\Nyou should be able to interrupt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You share a fateful bond{\i}\N{\i1}with the Trojan Horse.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger. Can you catch up with us?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dren... have you forgotten\Nwhom you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alter course, minus 110!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going after the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Artesia...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't ever forgive the Zabi family.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please don't get in my way...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't approve of what you're doing, Casval.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So there are other sections of Gundam\Nthat are still severed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:55.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please replace the TC-17 block too.\NIt took a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:09:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we talk for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was wondering... What do I have to do\Nto quickly become a good pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you're already\Na good pilot, Ms. Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter me, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to survive, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:17.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're acting strange all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even I'd like to stand a chance against Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:26.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! When he was using Zaku types\Neven I could fight him. But now he's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just an example, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only I were like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just a minute. I'm confirming the data.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three enemy vessels detected\Nat one o'clock, 30 degrees overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They appear to be Musai types.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three Musai types detected!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please go to battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.09,0:10:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Zanzibar's behind us,\Nand the Musais before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:11:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to break through them.\NAll hands, level 1 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Entering first combat speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All machine guns, check defenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:08.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E.C.M. and laser searchers at maximum!\NDisperse combat level Minovsky particles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Level 1 battle stations!\NLet's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open machine gun turrets, main cannons,\Nmega particle cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll use the same tactics as Captain Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're sending six Rick Doms, Camel,\Nand Tokumel to attack the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I seem to have a fateful attraction to{\i}\N{\i1}the Trojan Horse and the Gundam.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All craft full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:31.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our targets have passed the F line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:34.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're Dom-type mobile suits.\NThe kind with skirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! Send Lieutenant Sleggar\Nin the spare G-Fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Sleggar! Please board\Nthe G-Fighter on Deck 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:47.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a pain. Wasn't I supposed to be\Non the main cannons?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hayato in the Guntank, heading out!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You're pumped,\NCorporal Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:04.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please take note.\NDon't rely too much on this computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:07.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only accessible in G-Armor mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, the G-Fighter\Nis manually operated?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suits me fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright. Do you think\NLieutenant Sleggar will be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Guntank and Guncannon\Naren't suited for high-speed combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The more weapons we deploy, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reaching enemy in 90 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Musais are also closing\Nat maximum combat speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla! Time to wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:38.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla's already on Deck 2.\NShe wants to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. Is she alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're not the mobile suits\Nfrom the Zanzibar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a little out of sorts,\Nso I'll work it off with some action.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla. You're acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think so? I feel a lot better than I did earlier.\NDon't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.92,0:13:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How impertinent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the Trojan Horse doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They seem to have detected the Musais.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're increasing speed,\Nbut staying on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice move. They're trying\Nto break through the Musais.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Order the Camel fleet to concentrate\Nall of their fire on the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Accelerate Zanzibar 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:25.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay on course after the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...having left Jaburo in South America...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Admiral Tianem and his group of\Nthe Federation's Second Combined Fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...were leaving Earth's atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were setting a course for Luna II.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:15:02.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now's my chance to prove{\i}\N{\i1}I'm a great pilot, too. Let's see now...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that Mr. Sleggar?\NYou're jumping the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At times like these, he who rushes... loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:21.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've split into two groups.\NIn that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, if Hayato's going left, I'll go...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are both Kai and Lt. Sleggar\Ndistancing themselves from the Guntank?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we separate just like the enemy,\Nthere's no way we'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? Ms. Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hayato, do you read me? We'll only win...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...if we coordinate with the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two think they can win on their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that. Ms. Sayla and I will\Nmove in behind Kai and Sleggar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotta lure him closer...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:07.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man! You sure are a lot calmer\Nthan I would've figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:17.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I misjudged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the last one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire at the area\Nwhere the Doms were destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:00.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Charge the Trojan Horse all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come in, White Base, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:10.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla here! We're heading back\Nto defend the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please do! We need to get rid of the "skirts"\Nbefore we can start attacking the Musais.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Block 6 has been hit!\NIt's the fourth hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The barrage is too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's moving all around.\NTell them to just shoot without aiming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow. Where's the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.99,0:17:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almost ready. Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:35.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Musais have passed the F line\Nand fired beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the evasive maneuvers to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Main cannons and mega particle cannons,\Nfire at the Musai's bridges or engines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:18:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't just shoot blindly! Aim carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Direct hit to the portside Musai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who told you to aim for their turrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:11.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we destroyed the engine\Nthey couldn't use their beam cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Concentrate your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Direct all shots to the portside Musai!\NDon't even look at the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry for the wait!{\i}\N{\i1}The Gundam's ready for takeoff!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry! The Musais are our targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignore the skirted mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger that!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A skirted suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,T-Tokumel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.51,0:19:08.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Order the two Rick Doms to retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're in our line of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Camel, Swamel,\Nwe'll destroy the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:17.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must take them out\Nbefore Captain Char arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:21.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two Musais... coming now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gunners! Aim at the portside Musai!\NForget about the one to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?! I can't hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whose Rick Dom is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:43.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Frasy's!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says he hasn't seen the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!\NThen where's it hiding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did we get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! We hit one of their mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We almost have them!\NDon't let up fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's impossible!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gundam must be there. Where is it?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:04.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Dren!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:05.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.81,0:20:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something's approaching from bearing zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:11.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems to be a mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:12.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,High-temperature object approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A missile?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not directed at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Swamel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Swamel! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's the Gundam.\NThat white mobile suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:57.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:03.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Above or below?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:04.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Below!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:20.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only the Musai is left!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:39.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought that even Dren\Ncouldn't hold his own until I arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse's course?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:48.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we take a direct route to Luna II...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:51.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...there's a 98 percent chance\Nwe're going to run into the Zanzibar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well. We'll head for Side 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I concur, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:22:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry I got the G-Fighter damaged...\NChief Petty Officer Amuro bawled me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were in a hurry to score points, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:09.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not really going to help us\Nif we head for Side 6...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we fought the Zanzibar in our condition...\Nwe'd have little chance of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's obvious even from the outside\Nhow badly the White Base is damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:21.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you foresee any problems, Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.65,0:22:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, not really... it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:27.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Side 6 is a neutral Side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:30.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Antarctic Treaty prohibits\Nany kind of warfare there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.85,0:22:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With luck, we can get the White Base repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.97,0:22:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's also possible we'd\Nbe surrounded by Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't help that. We'll worry about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.12,0:22:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are the chances...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.21,0:22:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altering course.\NRedirecting the White Base to Side 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.63,0:22:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Side 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of all the Sides that existed...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.11,0:23:00.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...it was the only one unaffiliated with\Nthe Principality of Zeon or the Federation...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and not participating in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All fighting is strictly prohibited\Nwithin Side 6 airspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.95,0:23:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Side 6, where reunions await.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:24.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mirai with Cameron.\NAnd Amuro with his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:28.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In war, are people inevitably\Nforced to shed tears?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.20,0:23:30.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then there is Conscon, who laughs...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and declares Char to be incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NFarewell in Side Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.67,0:23:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
